    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

    <title>French Garden Fleurence Sugar Bowl | KASODI</title>

    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Discover the French Garden Fleurence Sugar Bowl by Villeroy & Boch, a decorative premium porcelain piece with cherry motifs and fresh green detailing, selected by KASODI."
    />
  </head>

  <body>

    <Header />


    <main class="product-detail-page">

      
<div class="product-breadcrumb">
  <a href="/">Home</a>
  <span>&middot;</span>
  <a href="/kitchen">Kitchen</a>
  <span>&middot;</span>
  <a href="/kitchen/tableware">Tableware</a>
  <span>&middot;</span>
  <span>French Garden Fleurence Sugar Bowl</span>
</div>



      <section class="product-detail-hero">

        <div class="product-detail-image">
          <img
            src="/images/tableware/villeroy-boch-french-garden-fleurence-sugar-bowl.png"
            alt="French Garden Fleurence Sugar Bowl by Villeroy & Boch styled by KASODI"
          />
        </div>


        <div class="product-detail-content">

          <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
            TABLEWARE &middot; SERVEWARE
          </p>

          <h1>
            French Garden Fleurence Sugar Bowl
          </h1>

          <p class="product-detail-brand">
            Villeroy & Boch
          </p>

          <p class="product-detail-intro">
            A charming porcelain sugar bowl from the French Garden Fleurence
            collection, decorated with ripe cherries, leafy green details and
            fresh garden-inspired colours. Its softly rounded shape and
            decorative lidded design bring the character of traditional
            European tableware to breakfast, coffee and afternoon tables.
          </p>


          <div class="product-detail-divider"></div>


          <div class="product-detail-meta">

            <div>
              <span>Material</span>
              <strong>Premium porcelain</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Capacity</span>
              <strong>200 ml</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Dimensions</span>
              <strong>12.5 &times; 11.99 &times; 9.98 cm</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Colour</span>
              <strong>White &middot; Green &middot; Red</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Design</span>
              <strong>Cherry &middot; Botanical</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Care</span>
              <strong>Dishwasher & microwave safe</strong>
            </div>

          </div>


          <div class="affiliate-action">

            <a
              href="https://amzn.to/4ACg2FY"
              target="_blank"
              rel="nofollow sponsored"
              class="product-shop-button"
            >
              Find It Here &rarr;
            </a>

            <p class="affiliate-note">
              Affiliate link &middot; KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
            </p>

          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="why-we-love">

        <div class="why-we-love-label">
          KASODI NOTE
        </div>

        <div class="why-we-love-content">

          <h2>Why we love it</h2>

          <p>
            This is the kind of small tableware piece that can give an entire
            setting personality. The cherries, leafy border and soft green
            accents feel cheerful and decorative, while the classic porcelain
            shape keeps it elegant rather than overly playful.
          </p>

          <p>
            We especially like it on relaxed breakfast tables and for afternoon
            coffee or tea. Use it traditionally for sugar, or bring it to the
            table with jam or other small accompaniments. It looks particularly
            beautiful mixed with simple cream ceramics, green glassware and
            natural linen.
          </p>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-care">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          CARE
        </p>

        <h2>Designed for everyday serving</h2>

        <p>
          The sugar bowl is listed as dishwasher and microwave safe. To help
          preserve the decorative porcelain finish, avoid abrasive cleaning
          products and handle the fitted lid carefully when washing or storing.
        </p>

      </section>


      <section class="styling-ideas">

        <div class="styling-heading">
          <p>KASODI STYLING</p>
          <h2>Style it with</h2>
        </div>


        <div class="styling-grid">

          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>01</span>
            <h3>Green Glassware</h3>
            <p>
              Textured green glasses pick up the botanical border and make the
              fresh garden palette feel intentional without becoming too matched.
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>02</span>
            <h3>Natural Linen</h3>
            <p>
              Ivory, oatmeal or softly striped linen gives the colourful
              porcelain a relaxed background and keeps the table warm and
              informal.
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>03</span>
            <h3>Simple Ceramics</h3>
            <p>
              Pair the decorative sugar bowl with quieter cream or white
              ceramics so its cherry motif becomes the small focal point of the
              setting.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="continue-exploring">

        <div class="continue-exploring-heading">
          <p>TABLEWARE</p>
          <h2>Continue Exploring</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="continue-exploring-grid">


          <a
            href="/tableware/alori-amber-champagne-glass"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/tableware/kave-home-alori-amber-cava-glass.png"
                alt="Alori Amber Champagne Glass"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>GLASSWARE</span>
              <h3>Alori Amber Champagne Glass</h3>
              <p>Kave Home</p>
              <strong>Discover &rarr;</strong>
            </div>

          </a>


          <a
            href="/kasodi-edit/boston-green-wine-glass"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/kasodi-edit/kasodi-edit-villeroy-boch-boston-green-glass.png"
                alt="Boston Green Wine Glass"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>GLASSWARE</span>
              <h3>Boston Green Wine Glass</h3>
              <p>Villeroy & Boch</p>
              <strong>Discover &rarr;</strong>
            </div>

          </a>


          <a
            href="/tableware/talora-carved-glass-decanter"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/tableware/kave-home-talora-carved-glass-decanter.png"
                alt="Talora Carved Glass Decanter"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>GLASSWARE</span>
              <h3>Talora Carved Glass Decanter</h3>
              <p>Kave Home</p>
              <strong>Discover &rarr;</strong>
            </div>

          </a>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-final-cta">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          VILLEROY & BOCH &middot; FRENCH GARDEN
        </p>

        <h2>
          A little garden charm for the everyday table.
        </h2>

        <a
          href="https://amzn.to/4ACg2FY"
          target="_blank"
          rel="nofollow sponsored"
          class="product-shop-button"
        >
          Find It Here &rarr;
        </a>

        <p class="affiliate-note affiliate-note-light">
          Affiliate link &middot; KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
        </p>

      </section>

    </main>


    <Footer />

  </body>
</html>